Replace flat session-row figures and process/task badges with distinct card-colour squares before the existing gateway marks, preserving opt-in profile/PR chips, status derivation, hover actions and excluded Inbox card rendering. Remove only age/token/cost Show options; stored legacy values remain valid and sort keys stay available.

Proof:
- RED: new flat-row acceptance fails on the original age; new Show-menu acceptance fails on original Updated checkbox. New helper tests fail before implementation.
- GREEN: sidebar plus overlay-completeness, 63 files / 591 tests passed, single-worker vitest.
- TypeScript --noEmit passed (3 GiB heap; borrowed deps tree shared test modules explicitly linked).
- eslint passed after fixes; scripts/check --base origin/main: 21 checks passed, 0 blocking/advisory health findings.
- Actual component rendered in isolated jsdom fixture, then browser-painted using real styles: 6x6 px squares, 2 px gaps, 1.5 px radius; gateway follows squares. Screenshot retained by task t_339dc6ac777fd5c9; this is not installed Desktop verification.

English colour copy uses existing locale fallback; newly untranslated keys explicitly recorded in overlay gaps, as approved.
